  (text "TTL SERIES TERMINATION (33R)"
    (at 20 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e5e7d83c-ce84-5f1e-be58-ed813c06cd3b)
  )
  (text "J2: 50-PIN FPC (bottom side)"
    (at 100 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 6f033cfa-e4dd-5d24-aa04-be43d4d9ce25)
  )
  (text "J3: 40-PIN FPC (top side)"
    (at 185 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid b795e3e6-b84b-5f80-b82a-7fb1df1bcb7e)
  )
  (text "J2 pinout from the panel interface table supplied for this project (VLED+ 1-2, VLED- 3-4, ... DITHB 47)."
    (at 100 176 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9a653d59-c350-56a6-af61-67515398bc78)
  )
  (text "J3: common 40-pin RGB pinout (LEDK 1, LEDA 2, VCC 4, R0-R7 5-12, G0-G7 13-20, B0-B7 21-28, CLK 30,"
    (at 100 179.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid f6ce1188-bcf1-56f9-a6c8-be2e2b325fa0)
  )
  (text "DISP 31, HS 32, VS 33, DE 34, touch 37-40 NC). VERIFY against your panel datasheet before use."
    (at 100 183 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8da973cf-a2ee-5002-96d3-9d3158dcdf47)
  )
  (text "Fit only ONE of J2 / J3.  J3 is on the top side, J2 on the bottom side under it.  Check the FPC contact side of your panel."
    (at 100 186.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid daa11ae7-1830-5cc8-a581-c4641db3ce88)
  )
  (text "PANEL STRAPS"
    (at 270 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 93670df6-5899-5f1a-9ab8-ca07f1cd30c9)
  )
  (text "Defaults (bridged pads 1-2): MODE = H (DE mode), SHLR = H, UPDN = L (normal scan), DITHB = L (8-bit)."
    (at 270 92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1a90d32e-7cff-5750-9cfe-e4060464f306)
  )
  (text "Cut the bridged side and solder the other side to change a strap.  R33/C50: panel reset RC."
    (at 270 95.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e27ac169-531d-5037-85ba-d556cd359b6c)
  )
  (text "PANEL LOGIC SUPPLY SWITCH"
    (at 270 106 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid fd5bea74-c54e-537c-ac3c-43fcd127e669)
  )
  (text "PANEL_ON (RTD pin 110) high = panel on, as on PCB800099."
    (at 300 172 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid db9157e8-8033-5630-85ea-a5a6d8a38853)
  )
  (text "R36/C51 slow the turn-on (about 1 ms) to limit inrush."
    (at 300 175.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 78581eee-54c4-5965-bcfb-9d332a7f8986)
  )
  (text "PANEL BIAS (50-pin panels only): AVDD boost, VGH / VGL charge pumps, VCOM buffer"
    (at 20 200 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid bc64f5f4-e507-5928-b31e-c8a7324c0e33)
  )
  (text "AVDD = 0.6 V x (1 + R37/R38) = 9.6 V (typical for 1024x600 50-pin panels).  AT070TN92 needs 10.4 V: R37 = 162k."
    (at 20 273 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e9c55c8c-b37b-5010-85ae-3fd209abaa1c)
  )
  (text "U6 runs from the switched LCD_3V3, so AVDD/VGH/VGL are off whenever the panel logic supply is off."
    (at 20 276.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 694602ec-959e-510a-9bba-4c5c6457e88c)
  )
  (text "VGH = 2 x AVDD - 0.6 V = 18.6 V, clamped by D4 (18 V).  VGL = -(AVDD - 0.6 V), clamped by D6 (-6.2 V).  Change D4/D6 to match the panel."
    (at 20 280 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 70c9ae55-728e-59a9-ad29-8bfda27f354e)
  )
  (text "VCOM adjustable 1.4 ... 4.1 V with RV1 (typ. 3.2-3.9 V): trim for minimum flicker."
    (at 20 283.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 10dc7da5-44ce-55ae-9c13-06735d670716)
  )
